{%- comment -%}
  Collection body lives in Shopify admin. Override leftover Rafter M copy
  and empty brand / bestseller intros until admin descriptions are updated.

  Note: several handles do not match their titles (legacy "-copy" handles
  from duplicated collections). Verified against live Shopify 2026-08-17:
    resistol-copy                 -> Bigalli
    best-selling-stetsons-copy-1  -> Best Selling Pendleton
    best-selling-goorin-bros-copy -> Best Selling Bigalli
    best-selling-pendleton-copy   -> Best Selling Lucchese
    best-selling-stetsons-copy    -> Best Selling Resistol
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- if collection.handle == 'hat-experiences' -%}
  <p>Visit us at 2218 N College Avenue in Fayetteville. Walk in or book a Free Hat Experience — we fit you, shape the crown, and finish it with trim you choose.</p>
  <p>Stetson, Resistol, and Charlie 1 Horse on the wall. Complimentary shaping on hats bought here.</p>
{%- elsif collection.handle == 'boots' -%}
  <p>Lucchese has been building boots by hand since 1883. Heritage you can feel in the leather. That's why they're the only boot on our shelf — we don't carry anything we wouldn't stand behind.</p>
  <p>Come try a pair in Fayetteville. Most popular options below; the floor has more than the site.</p>
  <p><strong>Boots are in-store only.</strong> The website does not show every size or style on the floor.</p>
{%- elsif collection.handle == 'resistol-copy' -%}
  <p>Bigalli has been making hats since 1926 — Italian finishing on Ecuadorian straw. Light on the head, clean in the hand. The ones we keep on the wall.</p>
{%- elsif collection.handle == 'best-selling-stetsons-copy-1' -%}
  <p>Pendleton has run the same Oregon wool mill since 1863. Blankets, layers, and small goods with the geometric language they have used for generations.</p>
{%- elsif collection.handle == 'best-selling-goorin-bros-copy' -%}
  <p>The Bigalli pieces people actually take home — straw you can wear in Arkansas heat, finished the Italian way.</p>
{%- elsif collection.handle == 'best-selling-pendleton-copy' -%}
  <p>Lucchese boots, hand-lasted in San Antonio since the 1880s. A smaller menu. Better execution.</p>
{%- elsif collection.handle == 'best-selling-stetsons-copy' -%}
  <p>Resistol, Texas-made since 1927. Built to resist all — the felt and straw we sell most.</p>
{%- elsif collection.handle == 'best-selling-goorin-bros' -%}
  <p>Goorin Bros. since 1895, Pittsburgh. Felt hats and Animal Farm caps with a family name still on the label.</p>
{%- elsif collection.handle == 'apparel' -%}
  <p>Hoodies, tees, and sweatshirts that sit next to the hat wall — Stetson marks, western graphics, nothing that needs a costume.</p>
{%- elsif collection.handle == 't-shirt' -%}
  <p>Short-sleeve western shirts and graphic tees — Stetson crests alongside Pendleton's Laramie and Aloha prints. Everyday shirts, not souvenir-stand prints.</p>
{%- else -%}
  {{ collection.description }}
{%- endif -%}
